                                                "sense_id": "d7a4a90b-659a-3575-8f36-812e270945ed",
                                                "text": "killing everybody is a stupid idea, and comatosing everybody is equally so."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43629503-674d-4439-8c1a-7d6396cd0553",
                                                "sense_id": "d7a4a90b-659a-3575-8f36-812e270945ed",
                                                "text": "[Liverpool is] #1 in the league for murdering and comatosing fans of othe rclubs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b15e3085-ad9e-4653-ade1-1053c699c725",
                                                "sense_id": "d7a4a90b-659a-3575-8f36-812e270945ed",
                                                "text": "Then slipping on my silky dernier and tights, g-strings sculpted my voluptuous cheeks, brassiere comatosing my wobbly knockers."
                                            }
